[00:03.390]In the beginning
{"最初之时"}
[00:07.040]I never thought it would be you
{"我从未想过会是你"}
[00:10.690]When we were chillin
{"当我们悠闲相处"}
[00:14.540]Smiling in the photo booth
{"在照相亭里微笑"}
[00:18.450]But we got closer (Yeah)
{"但距离逐渐拉近（耶）"}
[00:22.100]‘Till you were eating off my spoon
{"直到你共用餐勺"}
[00:25.850]And coming over
{"频繁造访我家"}
[00:29.600]And we would talk all afternoon
{"午后长谈不知疲倦"}
[00:33.350]Tonight we’ll just get drunk
{"今夜让我们买醉"}
[00:35.600]Disturb the peace
{"打破平静"}
[00:37.600]Bind your hands all over me
{"双手游走我全身"}
[00:40.950]And then you bite your lip
{"你轻咬嘴唇时"}
[00:43.200]Whisper and say, “We’re going all the way”
[00:48.500]Tonight, take me to the other side
{"今晚 带我跨越界限"}
[00:54.410]Sparks fly like the Fourth of July
{"火花四溅如独立日烟火"}
[00:58.160]Just take me to the other side
